not established — I wrote no report, so brief item 7 ("what did you assume") was never answered by me, and I will not reconstruct intent. Code facts that *suggest* unmeasured assumptions, stated as facts not motives: `vote_service.py:408` (pre-2904f21) merged instead of replacing, violating FR-02; `bfs_voteinfo_client.py:122` retained the hardcoded `6670/58.2` `sync()` stub (still present at HEAD — the gate, not I, documented why).

