No other *agent's* files overlap mine. `git show --name-status` per commit: `33aab13` (my work, 3 src files), `aebfafe` (test-author's gate: 2 new test paths only), `2904f21` (my dev4 continuation: same src files + spec line), `2579c21` (test-author: `tests/unit/test_spec056b_live_wiring.py`, `tests/unit/test_vote_service.py`, one report — all test/report paths I was forbidden to touch and never wrote). The dev2/dev3/dev4 dispatches edited my src files, but they share my persona (`8db013f7015c`) and were continuations, not collisions. I know this from the ledger rows plus per-commit name-status, not from memory.

